  "/iphone/buy": { h1: "Why buy iPhone anywhere else?", headings: ["Why buy iPhone anywhere else?", "We’ll make sure it works with your carrier.", "Can you connect my new iPhone to any carrier?", "Will my new iPhone be unlocked?", "What about carrier plans with my new iPhone?", "Is it cheaper to buy from my carrier?", "Let’s talk payment options.", "Should I buy with Apple Card?"], paragraphs: ["Get credit toward iPhone 17, iPhone Air, or iPhone 17 Pro when you trade in an eligible smartphone. Get credit toward iPhone 17, iPhone Air, or iPhone 17 Pro when you trade in an eligible smartphone. 1 Shop iPhone", "When it comes to purchasing a new iPhone, there’s no better place to buy than Apple. For all your questions about carrier support, payment options, and getting your new iPhone set up, we have all the answers you need.", "For sure. We can easily activate your new iPhone so you can keep your same number and rate plan, saving you a trip to the carrier’s store. A Specialist can even help you get connected via phone or chat. Show more Show less"] },
